{"id":"se_ance","lemma":"séance","pos":"noun","rank":1896,"glosses":["session"],"ipa":"/se.ɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b9/Fr-s%C3%A9ance.ogg/Fr-s%C3%A9ance.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"séances"},"formAudio":{"séances":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Roptat-s%C3%A9ances.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Dois-je le faire séance tenante ?","en":"Do I have to do it right away?","words":[{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to do"},null,null]},{"text":"Fais tes devoirs séance tenante.","en":"Do your homework right away.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"homework"},null,null]},{"text":"La séance a été reportée.","en":"The meeting was adjourned.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},null]},{"text":"Je reviens juste de ma séance de natation du matin.","en":"I just got back from my morning swim.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come back","l":"revenir"},{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"swimming, natation"},{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"morning"}]},{"text":"Faites vos devoirs séance tenante.","en":"Do your homework right away.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},{"g":"homework"},null,null]}]}